{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/460487-looking-for-spells","id":460487,"title":"Looking for spells","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-28T17:05:12-07:00","id":460487,"title":"Looking for spells","content":"Does anyone have an idea about any extra spells that might be fan created or whatnot? I need some ideas for creative spells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T12:24:58-08:00","id":790415,"title":"","content":"I've written a couple for special needs on given stories.<br /> <br /> Erzulie's Kiss: (****)<br /> Cost: 2 Legend<br /> Roll: Manipulation + Empathy<br /> <br /> The spell basically causes bad luck. It requires you to actually see the person, or else touch something that resembles or represents them.<br /> For days equal to the successes on activation, the victim only receives 1 success from a natural 10, and anything that doesn't turn up a success is now a botch. Rolling a 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, or 6 without any successes can result in a botch. They can spend a point of Willpower to negate the increased botch chance for a single roll, but 10s still only garner a single success.<br /> The victim gets to resists with (Wits + Fortitude + Legend), and it can't be used on a target with higher legend.<br /> <br /> Demeter's Tears: (***)<br /> Cost: 1 Legend and 1 Willpower<br /> Roll: Charisma + Empathy<br /> <br /> This basically plays up the relationship of the target's fatebindings. All of the victim's fatebindings increase by 1 for the duration, and the target is unable to spend Willpower in rolls not involving their fatebindings. The effects last for one day for every two successes on the activation roll. Alternatively, you could have every two successes apply to a single fatebinding, if that is more applicable to your storyline. Lastly, the fatebinding of this spell occurs AFTER the effects end, preventing an immediate backlash on the user (otherwise nobody would ever use it?).<br /> <br /> <br /> Countercurse: (**)<br /> Cost: 1 Legend + (1 Legend per level)<br /> Roll: Wits + Occult<br /> <br /> This one is pretty self explanatory. It cancels out the effects of another person's spells (and boons, if you like) by simply cutting the tangled up ties of fate that were placed by the original spell. The cost of the spell is 1 Legend, plus Legend equal to the level of the spell or boon being negated. The activation roll must garner more successes than the activation roll of the target spell.<br /> Fatebinding from this spell will be to the user of the opposing spell ONLY if it affects them directly. Simply negating a spell that they left waiting won't garner a fatebinding to the caster, but to the object or person they affected, instead. To be able to cancel a spell or boon, the caster must have some way of knowing what has been affected and how, thus allowing them to correctly conjure a counter to it on the fly (thus the Wits+Occult roll).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10163-toomuchjesus","name":"Toomuchjesus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T17:52:50-08:00","id":790587,"title":"","content":"Legendary Transformation (********)<br /> <br /> Cost: 1 Willpower +Legend (cost varies)<br /> <br /> Roll: Intelligence + Occult<br /> <br /> There are many legends which speak of mortals who earned the favor (or scorn) of the Gods and were blessed (or cursed) to become something other than their original forms. With this spell, the God is able to transform a mortal into almost any creature of Legend; the exceptions being Scions, Gods and Titans. The amount of Legend points spent to fuel the spell determines the base Legend of the transformation itself. For example, spending 1 Willpower and 1 Legend turns the mortal into a creature with 1 Legend rating. Spending 1 Willpower and 5 Legend turns the mortal into a creature with 5 Legend rating, est.<br /> <br /> This spell can turn someone into nearly any kind of legendary creature, but only works on ordinary mortals. Those who already possess Legend (like Scions) are thus immune to the spell's effects. The effects of the spell are permanent unless a counter spell is used to reverse it.<br /> <br /> For each point of Legend spent casting the spell, the victim is entitled to gain 1 level in an Epic Attribute or Purview / Boon. Future Attributes or Boons must be purchased normally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 12-21-2015, 09:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}